OL,3,GNEWSAC-section delay did not cause
OL,4,Ahigh-risk baby's death - coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby boy who died eight days after an
OL,7,Femergency Caesarean section could not
OL,8,Fhave been saved despite "missed
OL,9,Fopportunities" to deliver him earlier,
OL,10,Fa coroner has concluded.
OL,12,FRichard George Sajan was born on 3
OL,13,FDecember 2024 after his mother Jossymol
OL,14,FGeorge, 37, attended Blackpool Victoria
OL,15,FHospital concerned about reduced foetal
OL,16,Fmovements.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
