OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAC-section delay did not cause
OL,4,Ahigh-risk baby's death - coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard, described as the "most
OL,7,Fprecious" child by his parents, had
OL,8,Fbeen considered a high-risk pregnancy
OL,9,Fafter his mother developed gestational
OL,10,Fdiabetes, but medics initially failed
OL,11,Fto recognise the danger he was in.
OL,13,FExperts told Blackpool Coroners' Court
OL,14,Fthe failure likely did not contribute
OL,15,Fto his death, and a conclusion of
OL,16,Fnatural causes was recorded.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
